This project implements methods described in Differentially Private Bootstrap:
New Privacy Analysis and Inference Strategies, by Zhanyu Wang, Guang Cheng,
and Jordan Awan (https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.06140).

Reference comparisons use the authors' Apache-2.0-licensed implementation at
https://github.com/Zhanyu-Wang/Differentially_Private_Bootstrap, pinned to
commit fd001561ed338d47143c94b995f4d47478ab9eb0. That checkout is obtained
separately and is not included in this distribution.

Reference comparisons also use the separately installed deconvolveR package
by Bradley Efron and Balasubramanian Narasimhan, licensed GPL-2.0-or-later.
That package is not included in this distribution. Core inference is an
independent NumPy/SciPy implementation. See ACKNOWLEDGMENTS.md in the project
repository for additional attribution and fixture provenance.

Third-party dependencies retain their respective licenses.
